  "description": "Watch now | Stock Market Breakouts are Happening. Its Time To Get Aggressive",
  "body_html": "<p>There is a method to the madness here. You can see the prior Mid-Week mover’s winning stocks down below, and their performance. Please note, some weeks I will NOT do Mid-Week movers, simply because the market is, in my opinion, not optimal for stock buying. </p><p><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/top-stock-is-perfect?r=4z8lgl\">22 July Winner (click to view):</a> </strong></p><ul><li><p>Cloudflare, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$NET&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>:   +7.9% currently, +14.6% local peak</p></li></ul><p><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/2-winning-stocks-with-strong-fundamentals?r=4z8lgl\">07 July Winner (click to view):</a></strong></p><ul><li><p>Victoria Secret, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$VSXY&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>: +20.3% and Snowflake, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$SNOW&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>: +23.4% </p></li></ul><p><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/top-stock-has-the-best-vcp-ive-seen\">24 June Winner (click to view):</a></strong></p><ul><li><p>Entravision Communications, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$EVC&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>: +8.2% currently, +28.2% local peak </p></li></ul><h3>Sorting through 27 tickers, many of them were good. </h3><h3>Last Place </h3><p>I know some of you are trying to sucker me into picking a stock on discount. Its not going to happen! If the stock price is below the 200 day moving average, it <em><strong>automatically</strong></em> goes to last place. We cannot time bottoms, so we have no idea where that is at. We do not fight down trends. You cannot hit 52 week highs or all time highs, quickly, if we are below that point. So the following stocks are eliminated:</p><ul><li><p>TRMB</p></li><li><p>ONDS (close to moving average, but need the proof).</p></li><li><p>XYL</p></li><li><p>PDYN (lower highs makes this a complete avoid)</p></li><li><p>INFQ</p></li></ul><h3>Weakest Trends</h3><p>Here I am just eliminating stocks that have underperformed the most in comparison to the S&amp;P 500. If trend is not friend, or not as friendly, then it gives me less reasoning to buy it. We want established trends, preferably with strength and momentum. This does NOT mean the stock cannot go up…things may change. But I do not have a crystal ball, and I am trying to quickly eliminate names, and choose the BEST stock today. All of these stocks had a relative strength (RS) below 65:</p><ul><li><p>MO: 57.17</p></li><li><p>ABBV: 61.46</p></li><li><p>LLY: 61.75</p></li><li><p>CIEN: 62.1</p></li><li><p>CZR: 62.69</p></li><li><p>PARR: 63.3</p></li><li><p>ONB: 63.95</p></li></ul><h3>Worst Fundamentals In The Group</h3><p>Though bad earnings are not a “show stopper”, I would prefer to give you a stock that has everything going for it. Trend, chart structure, breakouts, high volume, good cash flow and great earnings. We want everything that can help us, in our favor, to increase the probability of winning. With this, I eliminated 5 of the 15 remaining stocks:</p><ul><li><p>NTNX</p></li><li><p>VSAT</p></li><li><p>PANW</p></li><li><p>AAOI</p></li><li><p>FIVE</p></li></ul><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!msSM!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe2067b34-9417-4695-97b5-5de3f83ab043_880x302.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!msSM!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe2067b34-9417-4695-97b5-5de3f83ab043_880x302.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!msSM!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe2067b34-9417-4695-97b5-5de3f83ab043_880x302.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!msSM!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe2067b34-9417-4695-97b5-5de3f83ab043_880x302.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!msSM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe2067b34-9417-4695-97b5-5de3f83ab043_880x302.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!msSM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe2067b34-9417-4695-97b5-5de3f83ab043_880x302.png\" width=\"880\" height=\"302\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/e2067b34-9417-4695-97b5-5de3f83ab043_880x302.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:302,&quot;width&quot;:880,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:21418,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/210088385?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe2067b34-9417-4695-97b5-5de3f83ab043_880x302.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!msSM!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe2067b34-9417-4695-97b5-5de3f83ab043_880x302.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!msSM!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe2067b34-9417-4695-97b5-5de3f83ab043_880x302.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!msSM!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe2067b34-9417-4695-97b5-5de3f83ab043_880x302.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!msSM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe2067b34-9417-4695-97b5-5de3f83ab043_880x302.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><h3>7 of them all looked like they had bullish continuations to them. But the top stock, I could not find a reason to “ding” it… ⬇️</h3>",
